{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261116%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E9%87%8D%E9%BB%9E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E9%80%9F%E8%A6%BD_01-1024x1024.png\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>🔸高等法院<br/>► 0930　10庭　暫委法官祁彥輝<br/>蔡天鳳案　前夫、家翁及大伯否認謀殺罪｜續審<br/>► 1030　33庭　暫委法官張潔宜<br/>蔡天鳳案　女子助鄺港智潛逃罪成判囚半年提上訴｜宣讀判詞</p>\n<p>🔸區域法院<br/>► 1000　25庭　暫委法官鄧少雄<br/>興達大廈大維修圍標案｜續審<br/>► 1430　31庭　暫委法官梁嘉琪<br/>男警涉私藏懷疑酒駕女司機血液樣本於家中雪櫃不送檢｜續審</p>\n<p>🔸東區法院<br/>► 1430　1庭　總裁判官蘇惠德<br/>大律師蘇信恩涉非禮及普通襲擊｜答辯<br/>► 0930　4庭　裁判官王證瑜<br/>副校長涉私家車內非禮女子｜開審</p>\n<p>🔸九龍城法院<br/>► 0930　2庭　暫委裁判官周德興<br/>33歲男教師涉兩度非禮女童｜開審</p>\n<hr/>\n<p>「重點法庭案件速覽」是根據法庭日誌內，我們認為大眾會關注的翌日案件，選取出來以方便讀者閱覽</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T10:59:31.095532+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":374,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T10:48:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T06:47:32.790864+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T10:53:17.700289+00:00","content_hash":"75c734002b894f423f9848042b24269993207af65f4392ab3e869c9350f0655b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}